{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a boy searching for your friends after they got trapped inside the mall. Now, your goal is to find them and escape the place before dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful... something is waiting for you, watching you, studying you from the darkness... Of course, it won't let you escape that easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/e6cc19beba163d4f8fd7877f568b7613.avif?t=1774582849\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/71b4e9524c1184dea4764a21e4deb618.poster.avif?t=1774582849\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/71b4e9524c1184dea4764a21e4deb618.webm?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/71b4e9524c1184dea4764a21e4deb618.mp4?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to AniMall's Shopping!\u00a0</strong>We offer a wide variety of services and stores: Shops, Toy Stores, a <strong>Food Court</strong>, a <strong>Game Center</strong>, a big <strong>Cinema</strong>, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/710167e41dd0fec5c5d9b66da4435491.avif?t=1774582849\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/1a6a87f3f7bf6d434bc61977cdefcd18.poster.avif?t=1774582849\" width=620 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/1a6a87f3f7bf6d434bc61977cdefcd18.webm?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/1a6a87f3f7bf6d434bc61977cdefcd18.mp4?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn how they behave</strong>, and master how to <strong>detect</strong>, <strong>stun</strong>, and <strong>avoid</strong> them. Each one has something that makes them unique, so the fewer of them near you, the greater your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/532624c23f1b4976796264c4ceb00151.avif?t=1774582849\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/c2e0501ad7063be5bc4896da4da9ba75.poster.avif?t=1774582849\" width=620 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/c2e0501ad7063be5bc4896da4da9ba75.webm?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/c2e0501ad7063be5bc4896da4da9ba75.mp4?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every step counts.</strong> Explore carefully, move with <strong>stealth</strong>, <strong>distract</strong> them with objects, or make <strong>noise</strong> to draw their attention. And if all else fails, <strong>outsmart them</strong> by using your own strategy against their behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/c9a6a907e24046ab468d5c60a4e1117f.avif?t=1774582849\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/ba993696adbb63c65bb1d2e96b5ceb3c.poster.avif?t=1774582849\" width=620 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/ba993696adbb63c65bb1d2e96b5ceb3c.webm?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/ba993696adbb63c65bb1d2e96b5ceb3c.mp4?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open doors</strong>, search for <strong>access cards</strong>, and activate <strong>generators</strong> to uncover new areas like <strong>warehouses</strong>, <strong>closed stores</strong>, or <strong>administrative zones</strong>. A massive place awaits your visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/a758c269092484c75f78b43d12267526.avif?t=1774582849\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/dee7af2f121c6f16fee184aed06297e7.poster.avif?t=1774582849\" width=620 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/dee7af2f121c6f16fee184aed06297e7.webm?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/dee7af2f121c6f16fee184aed06297e7.mp4?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover what happened</strong> in this place through <strong>arcade machines</strong> and a touch of dark humor. Who knows? You might just find a way to put an end to all of this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/6491098092643ab88932bf6b592d493a.avif?t=1774582849\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/d158a4e04d56d6ad8951496af3e58b74.poster.avif?t=1774582849\" width=620 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/d158a4e04d56d6ad8951496af3e58b74.webm?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907280/extras/d158a4e04d56d6ad8951496af3e58b74.mp4?t=1774582849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't take the same path. Don't try the same tricks. They won\u2019t stop until you\u2019re dead.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"8 PM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907280/b445816eea1036cc3029ce817fe1c22505dcc4f4.jpg"},{"name":"9 PM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907280/bf4a907d470028f20f35fb382470d7e775d0d0c3.jpg"},{"name":"10 PM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907280/954f8a9bbd55fd393f56124ab5877fbca4d23122.jpg"},{"name":"11 PM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea